# Maps the clean /api/* paths onto the Netlify Functions.
#
# `_redirects` rules are applied AFTER file and function resolution, unlike
# netlify.toml [[redirects]] rules — so these never shadow /.netlify/functions/*.
#
# There is deliberately no `/* /index.html 200` catch-all: this app has no
# client-side routing (every link is an in-page anchor), and a catch-all rewrite
# makes Netlify answer API requests with HTML.

/api/alerts  /.netlify/functions/alerts  200
/api/agent   /.netlify/functions/agent   200